## 5. Migration Summary Checklist

| Component | In-Memory (`InMemoryTaskStore`) | PostgreSQL (`PostgresTaskStore`) | Action Required |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Data Storage** | JS `Map<string, Task>` | PostgreSQL `tasks` table with JSONB | Run DDL migration script |
| **Dependencies** | None (Node.js built-in) | `pg` + `@types/pg` | `npm i pg && npm i -D @types/pg` |
| **Queue Concurrency** | Array index splicing | `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` | Implement atomic claim query |
| **Dependency Checks** | Synchronous array iteration | SQL `NOT EXISTS (unnest(depends_on) ...)` | Push dependency evaluation to database |
| **Persistence** | Volatile (lost on restart) | Durable ACID storage | Instant crash recovery for in-flight tasks |
| **Shutdown** | In-memory task wait | Wait for tasks + `await pgPool.end()` | Add pool teardown hook |
